              >
                <span className="font-bold">4.1 Video Management System (VMS)</span><br/>
                The VMS shall support ONVIF Profile S and G. It must be capable of handling 5000+ cameras concurrently.
              </div>

              <div 
                className={`p-3 rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors border border-l-4 ${
                  selectedClauseId === 'clause-4.2' ? 'ring-2 ring-cyan-400' : ''
                } border-l-red-500 bg-red-50 border-red-100`}
                onClick={() => handleClauseClick('clause-4.2')}
              >
                <span className="font-bold">4.2 Hosting Requirements (CRITICAL FLAG)</span><br/>
                The proposed cloud solution must have a primary data center located in the United States or Europe with a Disaster Recovery (DR) site in Singapore to ensure global redundancy standards.
              </div>

              <div 
                className={`p-3 rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors border ${selectedClauseId === 'clause-4.3' ? 'ring-2 ring-cyan-400 bg-cyan-50 border-cyan-200' : 'hover:bg-slate-100 border-transparent'}`}
                onClick={() => handleClauseClick('clause-4.3')}
              >
                <span className="font-bold">4.3 Analytics</span><br/>
                The system must support facial recognition with 99% accuracy.
              </div>

              <div 
                className={`p-3 rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors border border-l-4 ${
                  selectedClauseId === 'clause-4.4' ? 'ring-2 ring-cyan-400' : ''
